Z||000000||AusFiero||09-06-2001||10:17 AM||||Well heres the story.  Iwent to withdraw from my Paypal account and have read all their user terms and conditions. Well here they are trying to rip me off on exchange rates big time by using a rate that is non existent and does me out of AU$10 on a $150 transaction. They claimed all sorts of BS reasons why when I questioned them about it even going to the extent of making up a new fee that doesn't exist on their website.  They even say on their website they use current exchange rates yet try to charge one from early last week when the AU dollar was stronger.<P>Is there any USA government body that is the watchdog over companies like this as I am not standing for their BS excuses and trying to rip me off?<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||8
